anthers Fall Against Butler","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<strong>Chanute, KS-</strong> The Panthers drop a game at home against Butler. The final score was 8-4. The offense scored 2 runs in the bottom of the first thanks to a 2 RBI double from Luke Briley. The other 2 runs came in the 7th inning off the bat of Carson Hilton who had a 2 RBI single. The Panthers scored 4 runs off of 6 hits in the contest but unfortunately were unable to keep pace with the Grizzlies. ","type":"postgame","byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"PLgE5laRexONXXPMiLaKQtSJCr_wWlUP-R","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/NeoshoBaseball/","twitter":"GoNeoshoBasebal","instagram":"nc_baseball","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/17/Carson_vs_Butler.jpeg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Carson Hilton hitting against Butler. ","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/3/17/baseball-panthers-fall-against-butler.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[{"id":6170,"game_pregame_story_id":null,"game_postgame_story_id":3808,"date":"2026-03-17T15:00:00","end_date":null,"date_utc":"2026-03-17T20:00:00Z","end_date_utc":null,"time":"3:00 P.M.","is_doubleheader":false,"allday":false,"tbd":false,"team_prefix":"","status":"O","location_indicator":"H","neutral_hometeam":false,"location":"Hudson Field","conference":null,"conference_abbrev":null,"conference_logo":null,"is_conference":false,"show_atvs":false,"is_spotlight":false,"type":"recent","tournament":null,"sport":null,"schedule":null,"opponent":{"id":10,"prefix":null,"name":null,"title":"Butler","image":"/images/logos/Butlet-CC.png"},"media":{"video":"https://team1sports.com/neosho/","video_text":null,"audio":null,"audio_text":null,"stats":null,"tickets":null,"game_note":null,"game_promotion_name":null,"tv":null,"tv_image":null,"tv_image_link":null,"radio":null,"custom1":null,"custom2":null,"custom3":null,"gamefiles":null,"program":null,"program_text":null},"story":null,"result":{"game_id":6170,"status":"L","team_score":"4","opponent_score":"8","prescore":null,"postscore":null,"bid":null,"boxscore":"/boxscore.aspx?id=6170","line_scores":null},"game_facility":null,"promotion":null,"event_image":null,"pac_tickets":null}],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":6,"locked_ranking":false,"id":3808,"content_id":"3808","content_title":"Panthers Fall Against Butler","content_date":"2026-03-17T18:57:00","content_url":"https://goneosho.com/news/2026/3/17/baseball-panthers-fall-against-butler.aspx","content_image_url":"https://goneosho.com/images/2026/3/17/Carson_vs_Butler.jpeg","date":"2026-03-17T18:57:00"},{"title":"Neosho Wins First Conference Weekend Against Labette","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<strong>Chanute, KS-</strong> The Panthers won both games of the home doubleheader against Labette. The final was a 19-6 run rule after 5 innings and the final in game 2 was 5-1. In game 1, the Panthers scored in every inning they went to the plate. The big inning was in the bottom of the 3rd when the offense pushed across 12 runs in the inning. In total the Panthers scored 19 runs off of 13 hits. 5 hitters collected multiple hits in the contest. Zach Grossnickle got the win on the mound, bringing his season win total to 3. In game 2, both offenses were relatively quiet compared to the previous game with the Panthers scoring 5 runs off of 4 hits. Austin O'Gorman earned his 2nd victory of the season after throwing 7 innings, allowing just 4 hits with no runs and a season high 12 strikeouts. ","type":"postgame","byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"PLgE5laRexONXXPMiLaKQtSJCr_wWlUP-R","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/NeoshoBaseball/","twitter":"GoNeoshoBasebal","instagram":"nc_baseball","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/8/O_Gorman_vs_Labette.jpeg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Austin O'Gorman pitching against Labette. ","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/3/8/baseball-neosho-wins-first-conference-weekend-against-labette.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[{"id":6167,"game_pregame_story_id":null,"game_postgame_story_id":3805,"date":"2026-03-08T13:00:00","end_date":null,"date_utc":"2026-03-08T18:00:00Z","end_date_utc":null,"time":"1:00 P.M.","is_doubleheader":false,"allday":false,"tbd":false,"team_prefix":"","status":"O","location_indicator":"H","neutral_hometeam":false,"location":"Hudson Field","conference":null,"conference_abbrev":null,"conference_logo":null,"is_conference":true,"show_atvs":false,"is_spotlight":false,"type":"recent","tournament":null,"sport":null,"schedule":null,"opponent":{"id":45,"prefix":null,"name":null,"title":"Labette ","image":"/images/logos/Labette-Community-College.png"},"media":{"video":"https://team1sports.com/neosho/","video_text":null,"audio":null,"audio_text":null,"stats":null,"tickets":null,"game_note":null,"game_promotion_name":null,"tv":null,"tv_image":null,"tv_image_link":null,"radio":null,"custom1":null,"custom2":null,"custom3":null,"gamefiles":null,"program":null,"program_text":null},"story":null,"result":{"game_id":6167,"status":"W","team_score":"19","opponent_score":"6","prescore":null,"postscore":null,"bid":null,"boxscore":"/boxscore.aspx?id=6167","line_scores":null},"game_facility":null,"promotion":null,"event_image":null,"pac_tickets":null},{"id":6196,"game_pregame_story_id":null,"game_postgame_story_id":3805,"date":"2026-03-08T15:00:00","end_date":null,"date_utc":"2026-03-08T20:00:00Z","end_date_utc":null,"time":"3:00 P.M.","is_doubleheader":false,"allday":false,"tbd":false,"team_prefix":"","status":"O","location_indicator":"H","neutral_hometeam":false,"location":"Hudson Field","conference":null,"conference_abbrev":null,"conference_logo":null,"is_conference":true,"show_atvs":false,"is_spotlight":false,"type":"recent","tournament":null,"sport":null,"schedule":null,"opponent":{"id":45,"prefix":null,"name":null,"title":"Labette ","image":"/images/logos/Labette-Community-College.png"},"media":{"video":"https://team1sports.com/neosho/","video_text":null,"audio":null,"audio_text":null,"stats":null,"tickets":null,"game_note":null,"game_promotion_name":null,"tv":null,"tv_image":null,"tv_image_link":null,"radio":null,"custom1":null,"custom2":null,"custom3":null,"gamefiles":null,"program":null,"program_text":null},"story":null,"result":{"game_id":6196,"status":"W","team_score":"5","opponent_score":"1","prescore":null,"postscore":null,"bid":null,"boxscore":"/boxscore.aspx?id=6196","line_scores":null},"game_facility":null,"promotion":null,"event_image":null,"pac_tickets":null}],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":7,"locked_ranking":false,"id":3805,"content_id":"3805","content_title":"Neosho Wins First Conference Weekend Against Labette","content_date":"2026-03-08T20:34:00","content_url":"https://goneosho.com/news/2026/3/8/baseball-neosho-wins-first-conference-weekend-against-labette.aspx","content_image_url":"https://goneosho.com/images/2026/3/8/O_Gorman_vs_Labette.jpeg","date":"2026-03-08T20:34:00"},{"title":"Panthers Open Conference With Split","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<strong>Parsons, KS- </strong>The Panthers opened their conference schedule with a split against Labette. The first game was a 4-0 loss but bounced back in game 2 with a 17-3 run rule. In game 1, the offense struggled to get much of anything going resulting in no runs and a loss. In game 2, the Panthers flipped a switch. On the mound, Cayden Neuharth earned the victory after throwing 5 innings, while allowing just 1 unearned run and 4 hits. The offense came out of the gate swinging with 1 run in the 1st, followed by 4 run innings in the 2nd, 4th, 5th and 6th. The Panthers totaled 17 runs off of 16 hits in the contest. 5 hitters collected multi-hit games. Maverick Williamson lead the way with 3 hits, 2 runs scored and 8 RBI. Luke Briley collected 2 hits, 1 run scored and 3 RBI. Both Panther Sophomore's added a home run to their season total. ","type":"postgame","byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"PLgE5laRexONXXPMiLaKQtSJCr_wWlUP-R","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/NeoshoBaseball/","twitter":"GoNeoshoBasebal","instagram":"nc_baseball","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/5/Mav_vs_Labette_2026.jpeg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Maverick Williamson with a grand slam. ","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/3/5/baseball-panthers-open-conference-with-split.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[{"id":6195,"game_pregame_story_id":null,"game_postgame_story_id":3802,"date":"2026-03-05T13:00:00","end_date":null,"date_utc":"2026-03-05T19:00:00Z","end_date_utc":null,"time":"1:00 P.M.","is_doubleheader":false,"allday":false,"tbd":false,"team_prefix":"","status":"O","location_indicator":"A","neutral_hometeam":false,"locatio