"teaser":"<strong>Parsons, KS- </strong>The Panthers opened their conference schedule with a split against Labette. The first game was a 4-0 loss but bounced back in game 2 with a 17-3 run rule. In game 1, the offense struggled to get much of anything going resulting in no runs and a loss. In game 2, the Panthers flipped a switch. On the mound, Cayden Neuharth earned the victory after throwing 5 innings, while allowing just 1 unearned run and 4 hits. The offense came out of the gate swinging with 1 run in the 1st, followed by 4 run innings in the 2nd, 4th, 5th and 6th. The Panthers totaled 17 runs off of 16 hits in the contest. 5 hitters collected multi-hit games. Maverick Williamson lead the way with 3 hits, 2 runs scored and 8 RBI. Luke Briley collected 2 hits, 1 run scored and 3 RBI. Both Panther Sophomore's added a home run to their season total. ","type":"postgame","byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":"PLgE5laRexONXXPMiLaKQtSJCr_wWlUP-R","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/NeoshoBaseball/","twitter":"GoNeoshoBasebal","instagram":"nc_baseball","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/5/Mav_vs_Labette_2026.jpeg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Maverick Williamson with a grand slam. ","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/3/5/baseball-panthers-open-conference-with-split.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[{"id":6195,"game_pregame_story_id":null,"game_postgame_story_id":3802,"date":"2026-03-05T13:00:00","end_date":null,"date_utc":"2026-03-05T19:00:00Z","end_date_utc":null,"time":"1:00 P.M.","is_doubleheader":false,"allday":fal